# Cloud Computing Labs

A collection of Cloud Computing laboratory work covering virtualization,
KVM/QEMU, VM networking, and cloud infrastructure concepts.

The repository also keeps lab source code in one place, making it easy
to clone and use inside the VMs during practical work.

## Labs

- **Lab 1:** KVM Hello World and hardware-assisted virtualization
- **Lab 2:** QEMU/KVM VM Web Server + Client with Flask
